56
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:44,370
View System.

57
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:50,370
View System is responsible for building the essential view components of an application.

58
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:54,690
So it's basically responsible for inflating your layouts.

59
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:58,170
And these layouts has multiple types of views.

60
00:04:58,530 --> 00:05:04,680
So the view system is basically responsible for rendering these different views onto the screen.

61
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:11,850
The system runtime library layer is divided into two parts the C C++ library and the Android runtime

62
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:12,390
library.

