00:05:27,210 --> 00:05:34,170
So all the services which we use through the application are dependent on this C C++ library.

68
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,890
Below are some examples of C C++ libraries.

69
00:05:38,170 --> 00:05:43,050
So the first one is OpenGL ES OpenGL for embedded systems.

70
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:49,590
So this is basically a 3D drawing function library specifically designed for embedded devices.

71
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:57,840
Then we have the Lipsey ellipses, basically the standard C system function library inherited from BSD.

72
